  "notes": [
    "HELP is a team-managed project: its issue types, statuses and fields are its own, and its estimate field is usually \"Story point estimate\", not \"Story Points\".",
    "The hierarchy has a level above Epic: Initiative (level 2).",
    "Epic Link (customfield_10014) is defined but no issue uses it: issues reach their epic through Parent, as on Jira Cloud.",
    "2 fields look like a team: Delivery team (customfield_10201, on 24 issues), Team (customfield_10001, on 2 issues). The mapping must pick one.",
    "Estimates live in 2 fields: Story Points (customfield_10026), Story point estimate (customfield_10016).",
    "\"Ready for Release\" is in the Done category; if the team does not mean finished by it, map statuses by name."
